      "intent_anchors": [
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA1",
          "statement": "Keep the front face a single unbroken plane: the display window is recessed flush and the USB port is a flush gasketed door on the right side, so no feature crosses or interrupts the front silhouette.",
          "category": "form",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA2",
          "statement": "Keep the top vent deck as a 0.6 mm recessed, gasketed ePTFE membrane field covering at least 15% open area; it is the only air path and must not be moved to the front or rear.",
          "category": "usability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA3",
          "statement": "Keep the chamfered_slab silhouette with a 6 mm chamfer on all four long edges and a 26 mm overall height; do not substitute fillets or add a raised bezel, as this is what reads as premium at this cost.",
          "category": "cmf",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA4",
          "statement": "Keep rABS as the sole material with a 1.5 mm nominal wall and a two-shot perimeter gasket; no virgin ABS blend, no metal insert, to hold 100% recycled content and the CNY 16 ceiling.",
          "category": "sustainability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA5",
          "statement": "Keep housing mass at or below 59 g (total product <= 151 g) by using the slab's flat geometry and ribbed interior bosses rather than local thickening.",
          "category": "cost",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA6",
          "statement": "Keep the soft-touch paint as a matte overcoat on rABS with pad-printed and laser-etched graphics; do not upgrade to TPE overmold or IML, which would break the six-week tooling path.",
          "category": "durability",
          "must_preserve": true
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "The chamfered slab is the only silhouette that lets a 26 mm side wall read as thin: the chamfer catches a specular line and hides the wall thickness that IP67 gasketing demands, whereas a rounded_rect or pebble would look fat at this height. Putting the intake on the top face is the key DFM move \u2014 it separates the waterproof display/electronics cavity from the vent cavity, so a single perimeter gasket plus an ePTFE membrane vent (the R-vent resolution) can seal the unit without a labyrinth, and the vent field is recessed so it never breaks the slab line. USB moves to the right side as a flush gasketed door, which keeps the front face a single unbroken plane and avoids a second sealing interface on the display side. The 1.5 mm rABS wall at 122 x 72 x 26 mm yields a housing around 55-59 g, inside the relaxed 151 g mass, and the two-shot gasket plus soft-touch paint keep the housing inside the relaxed CNY 16 ceiling while preserving 100% recycled content. All six anchors are deliberately cost-driven: no IML, no overmold, no metal, no second display bezel \u2014 the premium claim is carried by the chamfer, the matte soft-touch, and the flush front, which are the cheapest levers available at 10,000 units/year."
    },
